    <section id="footnotes">
    
      <div><a id="footnote-1" class="footnote-offset"></a><a href="#footnote-1-mark">[1]</a> The reader may expect here the condition that $\mathcal{E}$ is finite locally free. We do not do so in order to be consistent with <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">II, Definition 4.1.1</span>, <a href="/bibliography/EGA">EGA</a>]</span>.</div>
    
